abstract: >-
  The TechStream DevSecOps Maturity Model (TDMM): a 5-level, 37-question structured assessment instrument for evaluating organizational DevSecOps maturity. Includes scoring rubric, gap analysis methodology, and advancement roadmap recommendations aligned with NIST CSF and CMMI-derived maturity scales.
